@startuml
!include _seq-style.puml
title 3.1.11 ViewUserDetail & History

actor "Admin" as A
boundary "User detail UI" as UI <<boundary>>
control "UserController" as UC <<control>>
control "UserService" as S <<service>>
entity "UserRepository" as UR <<entity>>
entity "ShiftRepository" as SR <<entity>>

== View user detail & shift history ==
A -> UI: select a user
activate UI
UI -> UC: GET /api/users/{id}
activate UC
UC -> S: getUserDetail(id)
activate S
S -> UR: findById(id)
activate UR
UR --> S: User
deactivate UR
S -> SR: findTop7ByUser_IdOrderByOpenTimeDesc(id)
activate SR
SR --> S: List~Shift~
deactivate SR
S -> S: build UserDetailResponse\n(schedule + lastLogin)
S --> UC: UserDetailResponse
deactivate S
UC --> UI: 200 JSON
deactivate UC
UI --> A: detail form + shift table
deactivate UI

@enduml
